{"name":"Blushing","hex":"#f0d1c3","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blushing","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of blush"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of one who blushes; a blush."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blushing"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blushing","blocks":[{"text":"Blushing or erubescence is the reddening of a person's face due to psychological reasons. It is normally involuntary and triggered by emotional stress associated with passion, embarrassment, shyness, fear, anger, or romantic stimulation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Blushing_girl_0001.jpg/330px-Blushing_girl_0001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blushing","wikidata":"Q1338786"},{"title":"Blushing (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Blushing is the sixth studio album by American band Copeland. It was released on Valentine's Day 2019 via Tooth & Nail Records. It is the band's follow-up to their 2014 album Ixora, as well as their second album released since their reunion."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f6/Copeland-Blushing.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blushing_(album)","wikidata":"Q65074344"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"blushing":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/En-us-blushing.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0f/En-us-blushing.ogg/En-us-blushing.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Werner's nomenclature of colours greys","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Werner%27s_nomenclature_of_colours_greys.jpg/500px-Werner%27s_nomenclature_of_colours_greys.jpg","ratio":0.79404761904